        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Sebastian\n- Products: Closer to the Sun\n- Companies: Sony BMG Australia\n- Events: free concert\n- Places: Federation Square, Melbourne, Flinders Street, Swanston Street, St Kilda Road, Flinders Street railway station\n\nFacts:\n- On 27 September 2006, some tracks from Closer to the Sun were premiered at a free concert at Federation Square.\n- On 28 October 2006, Guy Sebastian released Closer to the Sun, his third studio album, through Sony BMG Australia.\n- Federation Square is a mixed-use development in the inner city of Melbourne.\n- Federation Square is located at the intersection of Flinders Street and Swanston Street/St Kilda Road in Melbourne's Central Business District.\n- Federation Square is adjacent to Flinders Street railway station.",
